- Often questions concern geopolitical history (e.g., imperial or colonial possessions, independence dates).  
- Economic data may involve percentages representing sectors of a country’s GDP or similar metrics.  
- Biographical data may link individuals to cities or organizations and require genealogical or occupational knowledge.  
