     Output `query`: "What is the Jewish population in the United Kingdom, the country containing Northern Ireland where Colin Bateman, the author of 'Eddie & the Gang with No Name,' was born?"

   - Input `question`: "When did Hurricane Sandy hit the birthplace of One-Upmanship's performer?"
     `summary_1`: "Hurricane Sandy hit New York, the birthplace or home city associated with the performer of 'One-Upmanship,' on October 29, 2012."
     Output `query`: "On what date did Hurricane Sandy hit New York, the birthplace or home city of the performer of 'One-Upmanship'?"

   - Input `question`: "What year did Italy fight in the same conflict Albert I of the country Ezaart is located in took part in?"
     `summary_1`: "Italy fought in the same conflict as Albert I of Belgium, World War I, starting in 1915."
     Output `query`: "In what year did Italy enter World War I, the conflict in which Albert I of Belgium also took part?"

